  {
   "id": "road-96-141543@major-2026-03-03",
   "gameId": "road-96-141543",
   "displayName": "Tides of Tomorrow new trailer + demo update!",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-03T14:08:40.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey Hitchhikers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Long time no see!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re getting close to the launch of Tides of Tomorrow on April 22, our brand‑new game, and we’re excited to share some cool stuff with you.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Did you know the idea for Tides of Tomorrow originally came from Road 96? We thought, “What if every character who made it to the border was played by a different player?”",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "That question sparked the creation of our unique new feature: Online Story-Link!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And here is a brand-new trailer that breaks it all down.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We also released a demo back in October — and we just updated it RIGHT NOW!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/39322286/6c077f01c168faebc41c40a72f3cab23e5fdd7a9.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In this demo, you will discover one location from the opening act of the full game: Marketland. A vibrant yet unstable island, shaped by the decisions of another player you choose to follow— a friend, a streamer, or a stranger.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The update also includes boat gameplay, a feature our beta-testers loved. Give it a try!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you’ll enjoy the demo and we can’t wait to show you the full game!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "As always, we love sharing content with you — your feedback helps us build our games together.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "And if you haven’t already, don’t forget to wishlist the game to support us!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[dynamiclink href=\"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2678080/Tides_of_Tomorrow/\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "See you soon on the road… or out on the ocean!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
